<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>About — Asiantte</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body><SiteMenu /><main><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ASIANTTE</p><h1>Asian Beauty,<br/>Unapologetically.</h1><p class="lead">Asiantteは、アジアに息づく美しさと、身につける人の個性を讃えるジュエリーブランドです。</p><section><h2>自分の美しさを、自分で選ぶ。</h2><p>静かな存在感。揺るぎない個性。日常に寄り添いながら、あなた自身の美しさを引き立てるジュエリーを届けます。</p></section></main><footer>Asiantte <span>Asian Beauty, Unapologetically.</span></footer></body></html><style>:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#111;color:#fff;font-family:Manrope,"Noto Sans JP",sans-serif}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:2rem 6vw}header a{color:inherit;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-decoration:none}.logo{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:1.6rem}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:12vw 6vw}.eyebrow{color:#b08d57;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.16em}h1{margin:1rem 0 2rem;font:500 clamp(4rem,10vw,9rem) "Cormorant Garamond",serif;line-height:.82}.lead{max-width:34rem;color:#ddd;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.9}section{max-width:30rem;margin:10rem 0 3rem}h2{font:500 2.5rem "Cormorant Garamond",serif}section p{color:#aaa;line-height:1.9}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:2rem 6vw;border-top:1px solid #ffffff26;font-size:.7rem}footer span{color:#888}@media(max-width:600px){footer{display:block}footer span{display:block;margin-top:.5rem}}
</style>
